# packages/scheduler type-check baseline (S315-S1, Refs #315)
#
# Pre-existing `tsc -p packages/scheduler` error count on origin/main at pack-B
# time (tip 7a8595b). scheduler had NO type-check script, so `pnpm -r type-check`
# silently skipped it; this file lets the gate join WITHOUT fixing main's errors in
# a test-hardening PR (no-scope-creep rule, same shape as packages/mastra's
# S261-S2 baseline). Ratchet the number DOWN as errors are fixed; never ratchet it
# UP without calling it out in review.
#
# Why the tsconfig lost `rootDir: src`: workspace packages export raw .ts sources
# through the root tsconfig.base `paths`, so rootDir + cross-package imports made
# every ../shared|db|mastra source a TS6059 ("not under rootDir") error — the
# ~140-error class the base-tsconfig comment tracked as "any future scheduler
# rootDir/project-references fix". With noEmit the key is pointless; removing it
# dissolves the class and leaves the 27 real diagnostics below.
#
# The 27 errors (classes):
#   ../db/src/vault-credentials.ts          6  TS18046 'data' is of type 'unknown' (fetch json())
#   src/wake-runner.ts                      5  TS2339/TS2345/TS2769/TS7006 (AgentGenerationOptions shape)
#   src/wake-runner.test.ts                 4  TS2339 Property 'includes' does not exist on type 'never'
#   src/timeout-runner.test.ts              4  TS2741/TS2739 (runtime-config fixture shapes)
#   src/park-helpers.ts                     2  TS2345 ActivityEntry[] shape
#   src/adapters/opencode-adapter.ts        2  TS2339 'status' on { body: unknown } (non-ok Response path)
#   ../shared/src/model-settings.ts         2  TS2304 FormDataEntryValue (lib ES2022, no DOM)
#   ../mastra/src/tools/role-tools.ts       1  TS18046 'allAgents' is of type 'unknown'
#   ../mastra/src/sticky-session-fetch.ts   1  TS2552 RequestInfo (lib ES2022, no DOM)
# Cross-package pull-ins are counted because the program includes imported .ts
# sources; if a sibling pack changes those files' diagnostics, ratchet this number
# deliberately in that PR.
27
